file tools/c/convergence_prove.sh the same dispatch, written in both rather than in one -- a lantern that fires twice becomes a loom
file tools/fixtures/c/convergence_tree_prove_control.sh a Rishi operator planted in the subject repository and the shell-only prover planted back beside it
file tools/fixtures/c/convergence_prove_control.sh the same pair one file down, 18 readings to 22
