status GREEN -- convergence_tree_prove, convergence_prove, convergence_census, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_pin_capacity, reds_status_consistency, reds_spine_derive, unshared_citation, living_pin_near_bound, shell_dialect, spoken_ascii and ascii_comment each run GREEN by hand; six QA grades at A, B+, B, A+, B and B+; the hot roster pass and its counts ride in the commit body
recommend keep-going -- the census's shell-shaped population is the next mechanical lap in this lane, and the two provers' one fact under two verdicts is named on the card
